# SwarmSync Documentation

## Overview
SwarmSync is an RF-based multi-node communication system for UAVs.
Built using ESP32 and NRF24L01 modules.

## Hardware Required
- ESP32 Development Board (x2 or more)
- NRF24L01 RF Module (x2 or more)
- Jumper wires
- Power supply (3.3V/5V)

## Pin Connections (ESP32 ↔ NRF24L01)
| NRF24L01 | ESP32 |
|----------|-------|
| VCC      | 3.3V  |
| GND      | GND   |
| CE       | GPIO4 |
| CSN      | GPIO5 |
| SCK      | GPIO18|
| MOSI     | GPIO23|
| MISO     | GPIO19|

## Working Principle
Master ESP32 sends commands via RF.
Slave nodes receive and execute commands.
No internet required — fully offline.

## Future Goals
- Multi-UAV swarm coordination
- Autonomous flight path syncing